   "lines": [
    "Took a ride on my",
    "horse; he ^it^ will be",
    "the greatest pleasure",
    "to me this spring,",
    "as I shall ride",
    "him every day the",
    "weather is even",
    "decent. It was the",
    "one thing wanting",
    "for perfect enjoyment.",
    "In the afternoon",
    "I went in to the",
    "Jeffries' to look over",
    "their collections & dined",
    "there. Played whist",
    "in the evening."
   ],
   "rows": null,
